### AICL DATASET: searching/find_second_largest.aicl
=== SPEC ===
# AICL Example: Second Largest
# AX sub-language — compiles to real code.

Goal:
2nd largest

Layer:
Core

Behavior FindSecond
    Input: array
    Output: second
    Action:
        largest = array[0]
        second = array[0]
        for i in range(1, len(array)):
            if array[i] > largest:
                second = largest
                largest = array[i]
            elif array[i] > second:
                second = array[i]
        return second

